{"test":"[{\"question\":\"Qaysi holatda suv najas hisoblanmaydi?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Agar unga tuproq aralashsa\",\"answer_1\":\"Agar u muz holida bo‘lsa\",\"answer_4\":\"Agar quyoshda qizdirilgan bo‘lsa\",\"answer_3\":\"Agar ikki qulla bo‘lsa yoki oqib tursa va hidi, rangi, ta’mi o‘zgarmasa\"},{\"question\":\"Suvga poklovchi bo‘lmagan narsa pishirilsa, yoki unga aralashib nomi o‘zgarsa, qanday holat yuz beradi?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Suvning rangi o‘zgaradi\",\"answer_1\":\"Suv najas bo‘ladi\",\"answer_4\":\"Suv ichishga yaramaydi\",\"answer_3\":\"Suvning poklovchi xususiyati yo‘qoladi\"},{\"question\":\"Qaysi holatda tayammum qilinadi?\",\"correct\":2.0,\"answer_2\":\"Poklovchi va najas suv aralashib qolsa-yu, ularni ajratib bo‘lmasa va boshqa suv bo‘lmasa\",\"answer_1\":\"Suv sovuq bo‘lsa\",\"answer_4\":\"Suv quyoshda qizigan bo‘lsa\",\"answer_3\":\"Suv shirin bo‘lmasa\"},{\"question\":\"Pok va najas kiyimlar aralashib qolsa, qanday amal qilinadi?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Eng chiroyli ko‘rinadiganini tanlab namoz o‘qiladi\",\"answer_1\":\"Ularni yuvib keyin kiyinadi\",\"answer_4\":\"Pok deb o‘ylanganida o‘qiladi\",\"answer_3\":\"Har bir kiyimda bitta namoz o‘qiladi, najaslar sonicha va bitta qo‘shib\"},{\"question\":\"Go‘shti yeyiladigan hayvonlarning siyigiga qanday hukm berilgan?\",\"correct\":2.0,\"answer_2\":\"Pok\",\"answer_1\":\"Najas, to‘liq yuviladi\",\"answer_4\":\"Uch marta yuviladi\",\"answer_3\":\"Tayammum qilish kifoya\"},{\"question\":\"Oltin va kumush idishlardan foydalanish qachon joiz bo‘ladi?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Faqat bezak uchun\",\"answer_1\":\"Faqat tahoratda\",\"answer_4\":\"Faqat erkaklar uchun man etilgan\",\"answer_3\":\"Hech qachon — na tahoratda, na boshqa ishlarda\"},{\"question\":\"Kumush bilan qoplangan idishlardan foydalanish qachon joiz?\",\"correct\":1.0,\"answer_2\":\"Agar idish katta bo‘lsa\",\"answer_1\":\"Agar yamoq oz bo‘lsa\",\"answer_4\":\"Faqat suv saqlashda\",\"answer_3\":\"Faqat taom uchun\"},{\"question\":\"Ahli kitoblarning idishlaridan foydalanish qaysi holatda joiz?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Agar ular sovun bilan yuvilgan bo‘lsa\",\"answer_1\":\"Agar ular yangi bo‘lsa\",\"answer_4\":\"Agar ular faqat ichimlik uchun bo‘lsa\",\"answer_3\":\"Agar najasligi ma’lum bo‘lmasa\"},{\"question\":\"Qaysi o‘lik hayvonlarning go‘shti halol va pok hisoblanadi?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Faqat dengizdagi hayvonlar\",\"answer_1\":\"Har qanday suvda o‘lgan hayvon\",\"answer_4\":\"Quruqlikdagi barcha halol hayvonlar\",\"answer_3\":\"Suvda yashaydigan va faqat suvda yashaydigan hayvonlar\"},{\"question\":\"Qaysi holatda o‘lik hayvonning terisi pok bo‘ladi?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Agar u halol hayvon bo‘lsa\",\"answer_1\":\"Agar uni yuvib ishlatsa\",\"answer_4\":\"Faqat terilangandan keyin\",\"answer_3\":\"Hech qachon, u har doim najas\"},{\"question\":\"Hojatxonaga kirishda qaysi duo o‘qiladi?\",\"correct\":2.0,\"answer_2\":\"Bismillah, a’uzu billahi min al-khubthi wal-khaba’ith\",\"answer_1\":\"Bismillah, astag‘firulloh\",\"answer_4\":\"Allohu Akbar, Subhanalloh\",\"answer_3\":\"Bismillah, Allohumma tahhir qalbiy\"},{\"question\":\"Hojatdan chiqqanda qaysi iborani aytish sunnat?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Astaghfirulloh\",\"answer_1\":\"Subhanalloh\",\"answer_4\":\"Alhamdulillah\",\"answer_3\":\"G‘ufronaka\"},{\"question\":\"Hojatxonaga kirishda qaysi oyog‘ni birinchi qilib kirmoq lozim?\",\"correct\":2.0,\"answer_2\":\"Chap oyog‘ini\",\"answer_1\":\"O‘ng oyog‘ini\",\"answer_4\":\"Qadam tartibi farq qilmaydi\",\"answer_3\":\"Ikkala oyog‘ini birgalikda\"},{\"question\":\"Qanday joylarda siydik qilish man etilgan?\",\"correct\":1.0,\"answer_2\":\"Faqat ochiq maydonlarda\",\"answer_1\":\"Foydali soya, mevali daraxt ostida, yoriqda\",\"answer_4\":\"Faqat shom vaqtida\",\"answer_3\":\"Faqat qiblaga qarab\"},{\"question\":\"Istinja qilishda qanday narsa ishlatish mumkin emas?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"Qog‘oz\",\"answer_1\":\"Toza tosh\",\"answer_4\":\"Yaproq\",\"answer_3\":\"Go‘ng va suyak\"},{\"question\":\"Tahorat va boshqa ibodatlar qachon to‘g‘ri bo‘ladi?\",\"correct\":3.0,\"answer_2\":\"To‘g‘ri tartibda bajarilganda\",\"answer_1\":\"Ko‘p suv bilan\",\"answer_4\":\"Faqat poklik bilan\",\"answer_3\":\"Faqat niyat bilan\"},{\"question\":\"Tahoratda boshi va quloqlarni qanday qilib mas’h qiladi?\",\"correct\":2.0,\"answer_2\":\"Boshdan ensagacha, so‘ng orqaga qaytaradi\",\"answer_1\":\"Faqat quloqni ishqalaydi\",\"answer_4\":\"Quloqni alohida, boshni alohida qiladi\",\"answer_3\":\"Faqat peshonani silaydi\"},{\"question\":\"Tahoratning farzlaridan biri nima?\",\"correct\":4.0,\"answer_2\":\"Soqolni hilollash\",\"answer_1\":\"Kaftlarni uch marta yuvish\",\"answer_4\":\"Tartibga rioya qilish\",\"answer_3\":\"Quloqlarni mas’h qilish\"},{\"question\":\"Misvok ishlatish qachon sunnat hisoblanadi?\",\"correct\":1.0,\"answer_2\":\"Faqat bomdoddan oldin\",\"answer_1\":\"Uyg‘onganda, og‘iz hidi o‘zgarganda, namozga tayyorlanganda\",\"answer_4\":\"Faqat juma kuni\",\"answer_3\":\"Faqat tahoratdan keyin\"},{\"question\":\"Ro‘zador uchun misvok ishlatish qachon makruh hisoblanadi?\",\"correct\":2.0,\"answer_2\":\"Peshindan keyin\",\"answer_1\":\"Bomdoddan oldin\",\"answer_4\":\"Har doim\",\"answer_3\":\"Iftordan oldin\"}]","book":"Umdatul Fiqh"}